# Build artifacts
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# Visual Studio / Rider local state
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Runtime data - keep the seeded database.db itself tracked (Initial commit ships it pre-seeded for
# local testing without Docker, see docs/docs/Getting Started + memory), but never its SQLite
# write-ahead-log companions or run logs, which change on every run and aren't meaningful history.
src/Executables/Single/data/*.db-shm
src/Executables/Single/data/*.db-wal
src/Executables/Single/*.log
*.log
